```javascript run
const hari = ["Sen", "Sel", "Rab", "Kam", "Jum"];
console.log(hari.slice(1, 3));
console.log(hari.length);
const dihapus = hari.splice(1, 2);
console.log(dihapus);
console.log(hari);
hari.splice(1, 0, "Selasa");
console.log(hari);
console.log(hari.at(-1));
```

Hasil di console:

```text
[ Sel, Rab ]
5
[ Sel, Rab ]
[ Sen, Kam, Jum ]
[ Sen, Selasa, Kam, Jum ]
Jum
```

- `slice(1, 3)` mengambil index 1 dan 2. Array asli tetap 5 elemen.
- `splice(1, 2)` menghapus 2 elemen mulai index 1 dari array aslinya.
- `splice(1, 0, "Selasa")` menghapus 0 elemen dan menyisipkan "Selasa" di index 1.

